> gm16r(a: u16, b: u16) = gm16(b, a)
> equiv gm16 gm16r
gm16 and gm16r are equal on the domain of gm16 (sampled, not proved; SAT gave up on 2276 AIG nodes within its budget of 100000 conflicts or 100000000 steps)
